Aim

To write a Java program to filter sensor temperatures greater than 50°C, calculate the average temperature for each sensor, and display the sensors sorted by average temperature
Program:
import java.util.Scanner;

class Sensor {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        int[] id = new int[8];
        double[] temp = new double[8];

        for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
            id[i] = sc.nextInt();
            temp[i] = sc.nextDouble();
        }

        for (int i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
            if (temp[i] > 50)
                System.out.println(id[i] + " " + temp[i]);
        }
    }
}
